<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="chest-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Chest for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>Your chest option will essentially come down to whether you're going for the 4-set bonus or not. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60349/magma-plated-chestguard">
<img alt="Magma Plated Chestguard" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Magma Plated Chestguard</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55060/elementium-deathplate">
<img alt="Elementium Deathplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Elementium Deathplate</span></a> will generally provide more value, but the 4-set bonus from <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60339/magma-plated-battleplate">
<img alt="Magma Plated Battleplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_chest_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Magma Plated Battleplate</span></a> is responsible for approximately 1,000 DPS and will thus be preferred if obtainable. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Chest Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52780/enchant-chest-greater-stamina">
<img alt="Enchant Chest - Greater Stamina" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Chest - Greater Stamina</span></a>
<div class="pad"></div>
