<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="bracer-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Bracer for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>Even if the BIS bracers are BOE, they will be very easy to acquire. With a <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> cap of 1600 and a cost of 1250, you can simply run a few dungeons on a main or alt and send these over to the character you're playing. I suspect they will not be very expensive at the Auction House either. Even if you prefer to save some of that hard-earned gold, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60228/bracers-of-the-matredor">
<img alt="Bracers of the Mat'redor" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_raiddeathknight_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Bracers of the Mat'redor</span></a> from the new <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/news/what-to-buy-with-fissure-stone-fragments-from-elemental-rune-dungeons-cataclysm-348669">Protocol: Inferno</a> will be a very good alternative, and may even be stronger if your objective is to push higher damage. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Bracer Enchant</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=62256/enchant-bracer-major-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Major Stamina</span></a> is our best enchant in Cataclysm Classic, unless you're <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=165/leatherworking">
<img alt="Leatherworking" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_armorkit_17.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leatherworking</span></a> and can use <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=85007/draconic-embossment-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Draconic Embossment - Stamina</span></a>. <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=96261/enchant-bracer-major-strength">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Major Strength</span></a> is also a viable alternative for offensive purposes.<div class="pad"></div>
