<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="boots-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Boots for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>In the boot slot, we have a great option with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69947/mirrored-boots">
<img alt="Mirrored Boots" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_plate_raiddeathknight_j_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Mirrored Boots</span></a> which may or may not be particularly affordable, especially early in the phase. Luckily <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60229/war-torn-crushers">
<img alt="War-Torn Crushers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_raidwarrior_i_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">War-Torn Crushers</span></a> will serve you well and is extremely close in value to the BOE option due to the extra socket bonus. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Boot Enchant</b>: <a class="q1 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=52743/enchant-boots-earthen-vitality">
<img alt="Enchant Boots - Earthen Vitality" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_enchantedscroll.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Boots - Earthen Vitality</span></a> | We are the slowest tanking spec, we need run speed wherever we can get it.<div class="pad"></div>
