<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="jewelry">Jewelry for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h3>
<div class="pad"></div>
<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="neck-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Neck for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>In the neck slot, we'll ideally want to go for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70929/firebound-gorget">
<img alt="Firebound Gorget" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_52.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Firebound Gorget</span></a> which is a BOE drop from Firelands. If you're not looking to spend money on BOEs or are looking to prepare your gear before Firelands comes out, the other options are extremely close in value with <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60227/caelestraszs-will">
<img alt="Caelestrasz's Will" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_46.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Caelestrasz's Will</span></a> arguably being stronger due to the free stats from the socket and the inherent bonus strength.<div class="pad"></div>
