<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Rings for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>Our Phase 3 ring options are fantastic and easy to obtain. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=60226/dargonaxs-signet">
<img alt="Dargonax's Signet" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_rubystar.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Dargonax's Signet</span></a> is the ring that stands out. Combine it with either <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70940/deflecting-brimstone-band">
<img alt="Deflecting Brimstone Band" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_firelandsraid_03a.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Deflecting Brimstone Band</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65382/cloudburst-ring">
<img alt="Cloudburst Ring" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pearlring2.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cloudburst Ring</span></a>
<span class="q4"> of the Faultline</span>.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Ring Enchant</b>: If you are <a class="icontiny" data-entity="skill" data-game="wow" data-type="skill" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/skill=333/enchanting">
<img alt="Enchanting" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchanting</span></a>, make sure to utilize <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74218/enchant-ring-greater-stamina">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Ring - Greater Stamina</span></a>.<div class="pad"></div>
