<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="defensive-trinkets-for-blood-death-knight">Defensive Trinkets for Blood Death Knight</h4>In Phase 3, Blood Death Knights will have a big arsenal of defensive trinkets at their disposal before heading into any raid. The best options are <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=68915/scales-of-life">
<img alt="Scales of Life" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_druid_balanceofpower.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Scales of Life</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65048/symbiotic-worm">
<img alt="Symbiotic Worm" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_qiraj_skinsandworm.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Symbiotic Worm</span></a> which are from Firelands trash and the new <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/news/what-to-buy-with-fissure-stone-fragments-from-elemental-rune-dungeons-cataclysm-348669">Protocol: Inferno Dungeons</a> respectively. But luckily the other alternatives are not significantly worse. <br/>
<br/>
<b>
<ins>
