<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="offensive-trinkets-for-blood-death-knight">Offensive Trinkets for Blood Death Knight</h4>While I generally wouldn't recommend swapping to offensive trinkets while tanking content you're under-geared for, having access to offensively stated trinkets is never a bad thing as there'll be content where it can come in handy, like raids on normal difficulty or while running Heroic Inferno Protocol Dungeons. Each trinket replacement for an offensive alternative will result in about 800-1000 DPS upgrade on single target encounters. <br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=65072/heart-of-rage">
<img alt="Heart of Rage" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_ahnqirajtrinket_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Heart of Rage</span></a> is extremely good and will be your BIS offensive trinket until Dragon Soul. <br/>
<br/>The following trinkets will net you the highest DPS from top to bottom.<div class="markup-table-wrapper">
