<hr/>
<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="weapons">Weapons for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h3>Your weapon choice in Phase 3 will essentially come down to two options which will depend on whether you prefer more damage or more survivability. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=70164/masterwork-elementium-deathblade">
<img alt="Masterwork Elementium Deathblade" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_73.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Masterwork Elementium Deathblade</span></a> is incredibly well stated for us, but has the drawback of a 3.5-second swing timer and that it may empty your wallet as it may be quite expensive to obtain. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=64377/zinrokh-destroyer-of-worlds">
<img alt="Zin'rokh, Destroyer of Worlds" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_archaeology_zinrokh-sword.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Zin'rokh, Destroyer of Worlds</span></a> or <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=63679/reclaimed-ashkandi-greatsword-of-the-brotherhood">
<img alt="Reclaimed Ashkandi, Greatsword of the Brotherhood" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_50.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reclaimed Ashkandi, Greatsword of the Brotherhood</span></a> will net you higher damage due to the 3.8-second swing timer.<br/>
<br/>For a slightly more defensive alternative, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=59492/akirus-the-worm-breaker">
<img alt="Akirus the Worm-Breaker" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_mace_2h_grimbatolraid_d_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Akirus the Worm-Breaker</span></a> will be a good pickup if the BOE alternative is too expensive. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Recommended BiS Weapon Runeforge</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=53344/rune-of-the-fallen-crusader">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_retributionaura.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rune of the Fallen Crusader</span></a> will be your best weapon enchant, even in a full beef build. <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=62158/rune-of-the-stoneskin-gargoyle">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_sword_130.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rune of the Stoneskin Gargoyle</span></a> provides decent utility on <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/npc=53494/baleroc">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Baleroc</span></a> on 25-man.<div class="pad"></div>
