<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="relics-for-blood-death-knight-tanking">Relics for Blood Death Knight Tanking</h4>As the stats granted by the relic are quite insignificant compared to some of our other items, we generally don't want to prioritize picking up <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71147/relic-of-the-elemental-lords">
<img alt="Relic of the Elemental Lords" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_sealoffire.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of the Elemental Lords</span></a> unless we no longer need upgrades from the <a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/currency=396/valor-points">
<span>
<img alt="Valor Points" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/pvecurrency-valor.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Valor Points</span></span></a> vendor. While your best secondary alternative is from the Molten Front, your justice point alternatives will tide you over just fine.<div class="pad"></div>
